/*
  Localizable.strings (en)

  FAHYBRIK — English (informal you). SECONDARY locale.

  Voice: spare, precise, no motivational filler. Coach-shorthand mid-sentence
  is fine. Sport vocabulary brand-locked: HYROX, AMRAP, EMOM, RPE, Z1-Z5,
  sled push, wall ball, ski erg, etc. — never translated.

  Anchor phrases:
    - "Train at the detail."
    - "The more Pablo knows, the more precise your plan."
    - "Pablo is building your plan."

  Glyphs allowed: ▶ ✓ ✗ ▲ ▼ · → ← " " ○ ●     NO emoji ever.
*/

